History                                                           3034 1451
09-12 The resolved resonance parameters were evaluated by         3034 1451
      N.Iwamoto.                                                  3034 1451
      The data above the resolved resonance region were evaluated 3034 1451
      and compiled by N.Iwamoto.                                  3034 1451
                                                                  3034 1451
MF= 1 General information                                         3034 1451
  MT=451 Descriptive data and directory                           3034 1451
                                                                  3034 1451
MF= 2  Resonance parameters                                       3034 1451
  MT=151 Resolved and unresolved resonance parameters             3034 1451
    Resolved resonance region: below 70 keV                       3034 1451
      Resolved resonance parameters were taken from Agrawal et    3034 1451
      al. /1/, supplimented by the data of Julien et al. /2/      3034 1451
      and Kim et al. /3/. The negative resonance was placed       3034 1451
      so as to reproduce the cross sections at thermal energy     3034 1451
      recommended by Mughabghab /4/.                              3034 1451
                                                                  3034 1451
    Unresolved resonance region : 70 keV - 180 keV                3034 1451
      The unresolved resonance paramters (URP) were determined by 3034 1451
      ASREP code /5/ so as to reproduce the evaluated total and   3034 1451
      capture cross sections calculated with optical model code   3034 1451
      OPTMAN /6/ and CCONE /7/. The unresolved parameters         3034 1451
      should be used only for self-shielding calculation.         3034 1451
                                                                  3034 1451
      Thermal cross sections and resonance integrals at 300 K     3034 1451
      ----------------------------------------------------------  3034 1451
                       0.0253 eV           res. integ. (*)        3034 1451
                        (barn)               (barn)               3034 1451
      ----------------------------------------------------------  3034 1451
       Total           9.5833e+00                                 3034 1451
       Elastic         2.1113e+00                                 3034 1451
       n,gamma         7.4718e+00           2.4364e+01            3034 1451
       n,alpha         1.5108e-04                                 3034 1451
      ----------------------------------------------------------  3034 1451
         (*) Integrated from 0.5 eV to 10 MeV.                    3034 1451
